1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,409
Ek aur banda rakhne ka soch rahe ho? Ruko.

2
00:00:03,399 --> 00:00:05,852
Aapko staff nahi, system chahiye.

3
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:09,693
Ahmed bhai ke orders ek sheet mein, stock doosri mein.

4
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:13,483
Approval WhatsApp pe, aur invoice kisi ke inbox mein.

5
00:00:13,473 --> 00:00:17,292
Har hafte ghante, sirf data idhar se udhar karne mein.

6
00:00:17,508 --> 00:00:20,977
Chalo, dukaan ke khaate aur munshi se samajhte hain.

7
00:00:21,189 --> 00:00:25,277
Pehla: ek hi khaata. Orders, stock, invoice, sab ek jagah.

8
00:00:25,403 --> 00:00:28,191
Doosra: ek munshi jo kabhi nahi sota.

9
00:00:28,181 --> 00:00:32,186
Stock bees se kam hua, to WhatsApp alert khud chala gaya.

10
00:00:32,242 --> 00:00:36,040
Teesra: roz ki sales report, khud owner ki email pe.

11
00:00:36,444 --> 00:00:40,006
Agli baar koi bole, Excel kaafi hai, to bolna:

12
00:00:39,996 --> 00:00:42,224
Excel khaata hai. Munshi nahi.

13
00:00:42,772 --> 00:00:47,419
Save kar lo, aur us dost ko bhejo jo abhi bhi sheets mein phansa hai.

14
00:00:47,509 --> 00:00:51,230
Follow karo. Aur free tees minute call ke liye, DM karo.
